{
  "description": "Cash-out and safe movements at the desk (CSH-06, PRD W9, owner answer 3 to W1-11): the check before one is recorded. Session …51 of the cashier …a5 (testing/desk.ts); unit Rs 1 = 100; the drawer should hold Rs 10,000 unless a case says otherwise. Expense categories: tea (…201, Tea), old (…202, inactive). Supplier: …c2 S0007 Addi Traders. Bank accounts: soneri (…301, a bank), jazzcash (…302, a wallet), closed (…303, an inactive bank). Each kind needs exactly its own field: an expense its category, a supplier payment its supplier, a bank deposit a bank of kind bank; to_safe and from_safe neither. The first problem, in order: no_session, not_session_cashier, not_permitted, amount_not_positive, amount_not_rounded, missing_target, extra_target, note_required (not for the safe), note_too_long, reference_too_long, over_drawer (money out above the expected cash, until confirmed).",
